","kind":"person","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"澄","person_id":"ehx_cqg_nfx_BB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依完整敘事角色判讀，原字保留，AI暫定。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":9754,"raw_end":9868,"raw_character_offsets":[9756,9757,9758,9759,9760,9761,9762,9763,9764,9765,9766,9767,9768,9769,9770,9771,9772,9773,9774,9775,9776,9777,9778,9779,9780,9781,9782,9783,9784,9785,9786,9787,9788,9789,9790,9791,9792,9793,9794,9795,9796,9797,9798,9799,9800,9801,9802,9803,9804,9805,9806,9807,9808,9809,9810,9811,9812,9813,9814,9815,9816,9817,9818,9819,9820,9821,9822,9823,9824,9825,9826,9827,9828,9829,9830,9831,9832,9833,9834,9835,9836,9837,9838,9839,9840,9841,9842,9843,9844,9845,9846,9847,9848,9849,9850,9851,9852,9853,9854,9855,9856,9857,9858,9859,9860,9861,9862,9863,9864,9865,9866,9867],"first_line":124,"last_line":124,"revision_id":2618531,"projection_sha256":"636b4855891dbbd39539fe80f1134a7d7a95886d4b71e311fc9db8fd06e7cf2d","source_layer":"received_biography"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangcheng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p007","text":"時王敦為江州，鎮豫章，澄過詣敦。澄夙有盛名，出於敦右，士庶莫不傾慕之。兼勇力絕人，素為敦所憚，澄猶以舊意侮敦。敦益忿怒，請澄入宿，陰欲殺之。而澄左右有二十絕人，持鐵馬鞭為衛，澄手嘗捉玉枕以自防，故敦未之得發。後敦賜澄左右酒，皆醉，借玉枕觀之。因下床而謂澄曰：「何與杜弢通信？」澄曰：「事自可驗。」敦欲入內，澄手引敦衣，至於絕帶。乃登于梁，因罵敦曰：「行事如此，殃將及焉。」敦令力士路戎搤殺之，時年四十四，載屍還其家。劉琨聞澄之死，歎曰：「澄自取之。」及敦平，澄故吏佐著作郎桓稚上表理澄，請加贈諡。詔復澄本官，諡曰憲。長子詹，早卒。次子徽，右軍司馬。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p007:m0001","kind":"person","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"王敦","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依完整敘事角色判讀，原字保留，AI暫定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p007:m0011","kind":"person","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"澄","person_id":"ehx_cqg_nfx_BB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依完整敘事角色判讀，原字保留，AI暫定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p007:m0014","kind":"person","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"敦","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual